                <paragraph eId="schedule-1__amdact-3__item-14__qstr-1__para-fe">
                  <num>fe</num>
                  <content>
                    <p>*Laminaria and Corallina decommissioning levy;</p>
                  </content>
                  <content>
                    <p>21  Application of amendments</p>
                    <p>The amendments made by this Schedule apply in relation to financial years starting on or after <date date="2021-07-01">1 July 2021</date>.</p>
                    <p>[<i>Minister’s second reading speech made in—</i></p>
                    <p><i>House of Representatives on 20 October 2021</i></p>
                    <p><i>Senate on 30 March 2022</i>]</p>
                    <p>(128/21)</p>
                  </content>
